<title>CYPRUS: Repo yield on Cyprus auction rises to 4.57 pct.</title>
<headline>Repo yield on Cyprus auction rises to 4.57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on a repo auction held between the Cyprus central bank and commercial banks was 4.57 percent on Monday from 4.41 percent at the last auction held on May 21, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Yields on the 72.0 million pounds worth of bills sold ranged from 4.43 percent to 4.71 percent. Bids totalled 80.1 million pounds. ($=0.507 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
